{"id":"ebbc02d2d7c7fc7f","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-logic-definable-closure.md","title":"ZFC Logic Definable Closure","display":"df-zfc-logic-definable-closure — ZFC Logic Definable Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic-definable-closure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic-definable-closure"],"display":"df-zfc-logic-definable-closure — ZFC Logic Definable Closure","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic-definable-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic-definable-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic-definable-closure — ZFC Logic Definable Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8be961bc3feb23bd\" href=\"?note=8be961bc3feb23bd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure\">58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,A,\\mathfrak M,L\\in V\">\\(C,A,\\mathfrak M,L\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8be961bc3feb23bd\" href=\"?note=8be961bc3feb23bd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure\">58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure\\text{-}with\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S(C,\\mathfrak M,L,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure\\text{-}with\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S(C,\\mathfrak M,L,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosure}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosure}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The four-place predicate exposes the language and is an exact alias of the canonical definable-closure atom; the historical three-place predicate is its existential reduct.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8be961bc3feb23bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure","status":"resolved","id":"8be961bc3feb23bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[58-df-zfc-model10-definable-closure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C,A,\\mathfrak M,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure\\text{-}with\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,L)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10DefinableClosure}_S(C,\\mathfrak M,L,A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic\\text{-}definable\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosure}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicDefinableClosureWithLanguage}_S(C,A,\\mathfrak M,L)","display":true}],"bytes":1301,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2470","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-logic-definable-closure.md|58-df-zfc-logic-definable-closure]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["8be961bc3feb23bd"]}